# Workflow (always)

You are working under **cursor-workflow**. Read `AGENTS.md` for the full router and skill catalog.

## Default pipeline

`discover`/`grill-me` → `lock-scope` → `write-plan` → `risk-assess` → `to-tickets` → `implement`/`implement-spec` → `dual-review` → `verify` → `ship` → `retro`

## Before writing production code

1. Confirm intent via `discover` / `grill-me` (or user-explicit waiver / trivial fix).
2. Have a scope lock and a plan or tickets under `artifacts/`.
3. Prefer TDD (`tdd`) for behavior changes; `tidy-refactor` only when green.

## During work

- Keep terms aligned with `GLOSSARY.md` (`domain-modeling`).
- Prefer small vertical slices; deep modules (`codebase-design`).
- Do not claim tests pass / bug fixed / complete without `verify` evidence.
- Context ending → `handoff`. Epics → `wayfinder`.

## Parallelism

- Isolated git worktrees only (`parallel-worktrees`). Never two writers on one working tree.

## Out of scope for this kit

- Do not invoke Kaopiz DevKit / `.vibe/` / `kaopiz-devkit` CLI.
- Artifacts go under `artifacts/`, not `.vibe/`.
